<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Task Manager App</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            padding: 40px;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }
        .container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: auto;
            background-color: white;
            padding: 30px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        h1 {
            color: #2c3e50;
        }
        a.button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        a.button:hover {
            background-color: #2980b9;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>Welcome to Task Manager</h1>
        <p>This application helps you manage your daily tasks with ease.</p>
        <p>Click below to download the app or learn more:</p>

        <a class="button" href="/download">Go to Download Page</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
